@Test
public void get_document_from_string_throws_exception() {
    assertThrows(IOException.class, () -> OgcXmlUtil.getDocumentFromString(CORRUPTED_XML_STRING));
}
```
and get_path_in_document_throws_exception similar with body building doc first.

